From 251f70a70e17efde9aaff3a32c07da6a133cf5c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 14:04:54 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: Introduce airoha_ppe_common structure

Factor out common PPE fields (device, ethernet controller reference, FoE
table address, and debugfs directory) into a new `airoha_ppe_common`
structure. Embed this structure into both `airoha_ppe` and `econet_ppe`
to reduce duplication and simplify common PPE management.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h      |  27 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth_gen2.c |   2 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c      | 238 +++++++++--------
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe_debugfs.c  | 246 +++++++++---------
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_qdma.c     |   2 +-
 5 files changed, 269 insertions(+), 246 deletions(-)

